 on the main build that I have for ReVC.
 
+## ImGui info
+The miami-dev-imgui branch has ImGui testing copied in from my miami branch, I almost got this building on Linux but I get some linker erorrs.
+
+I got this building on Windows, but ImGui is very buggy, I cannot move the mouse and the menu doesn't show up properly.
+Although, I did place ImGui into reVC this time instead of librw, maybe I should try moving it to librw. 
+
 ## Docker support
 This branch now has support for building with Docker on Linux, tested on WSL with Ubuntu 24.04 and a Debian 13 server.
 
diff --git a/premake5.lua b/premake5.lua
index 3231cba4..e0733182 100644
--- a/premake5.lua
+++ b/premake5.lua
@@ -491,6 +491,8 @@ project "reVC"
 		libdirs { "vendor/openal-soft/libs/Win64" }
 
 	filter "platforms:linux*oal"
+		-- Disable Wno-narrowing errors in Linux.
+		buildoptions { "-Wno-narrowing" }
 		links { "openal", "mpg123", "sndfile", "pthread" }
 		
 	filter "platforms:bsd*oal"
